+    }
+   ],
+   "source": [
+    "job.wait_for_done(error_on_incomplete=True)"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "The `error_on_incomplete=True` flag causes a Python exception if the job fails or is killed before completing successfully.\n",
+    "\n",
+    "A running job may be killed with [`job.kill()`](cryosparc.job.Job.kill). A queued, completed, killed or failed job may be cleared with [`job.clear()`](cryosparc.job.Job.clear). After clearing, the job goes back to `building` status.\n",
+    "\n",
+    "## Inspecting Results\n",
